  baslik: 'Is Online Therapy as Effective as In-Person? What the Research Says'
  giris: '"Can real therapy happen through a screen?" — it''s the question almost everyone considering online therapy asks. The good news: this is no longer a matter of guesswork. More than two decades of controlled research paint a clear picture, and the answer is stronger than most people expect.'
